CONTEXT Registry IN ENGLISH
PURPOSE CONTEXT Registry
{+ A context that consists of two files, joined by a plain INCLUDE.
A plain INCLUDE keeps its meaning: the two files form one context. +}

INCLUDE "part_of_registry.adl"

RELATION name[Person*Name] [UNI,TOT]
POPULATION name[Person*Name] CONTAINS [ ("p1", "Peter") ]

ENDCONTEXT
